  "overview": "Self Incorporated ★ Series about challenges of early adolescence Self-Incorporated: Self Incorporated is a 15-program television/film series designed to stimulate classroom discussion of critical issues and problems of early adolescence. It aims at helping 11 to 13-year-olds cope with the physical, social, and emotional changes they are experiencing.\"Self - Incorporated\" was created under the management of the Agency for Instructional Television through the resources of a consortium of 42 state and provincial educational and broadcasting agencies, with additional assistance from Exxon Corporation. Episodes: Self Incorporated 01 Trying Times Self Incorporated 02 Who Wins? Self Incorporated 03 No Trespassing Self Incorporated 04 Getting Closer Self Incorporated 05 Down and Back Self Incorporated 06 Pressure Makes Perfect Self Incorporated 07 Two Sons Self Incorporated 08 The Clique Self Incorporated 09 Different Folks Self Incorporated 10 What's Wrong With Jonathan? Self Incorporated 11 Family Matters Self Incorporated 12 My Friend? These videos are all to be used only for free, personal, educational purposes. ___________________________________________________________________________________",
